      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'LANCE: Galahad! You survived?. The whole kingdom is overrun with Ulrich''s
    hellspawn. If you were no match it might be time.... We have to claim the three
    Runes of Power if we want a chance at saving the princess. even then it may not
    be enough. Come lad we must train if we are to stand a chance'
